# Explicit upload manifest for `gcloud run deploy --source .`.
# Without this file gcloud derives exclusions from .gitignore, which risks omitting a file the
# Dockerfile needs (and silently falling back to buildpacks if the Dockerfile itself is missing
# from the upload — that produces a container that starts but serves 404 on every route).
# Keep the Dockerfile and everything it COPYs uploadable; .dockerignore still trims the
# build context inside Cloud Build.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
dist
dist-server
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
*.local
.DS_Store
